    "description": "**Context**\nReferrer records need their own VIP indicator, independent of Player/Sign-Up VIP flags.\n\n**Requirements**\n\n* Add a VIP toggle/checkbox on the Referrer record.\n* A referrer is not exclusively VIP or non-VIP — the same referrer can refer both VIP and non-VIP sign-ups; leave this open rather than locking a referrer to one type.\n* Commission/payout rate is the same for VIP and standard referrals for now — no separate payout matrix needed at this time. Explicitly out of scope for this ticket; confirm with Kobi/Joyce before building any rate logic later.\n\n**Constraints / Dependencies**\nNone called out.\n\n**Source**\nFathom — WagerTech <> Jumpr Weekly Sync, 09/23/2026 (https://fathom.video/calls/831090060) — Joyce Kiddell \\~1:03:05–1:04:31, Kobi Kunasekaran \\~1:04:14–1:04:21, Emily Vandenberg \\~1:04:31. Also Taryn's notes, Joyce VIP > \"Referrer VIP checkbox.\"",
